<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $.50 lower.</p>
<p>Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   60.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   60.00-60.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   59.00-60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs   58.00-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs   57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs   56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows, 0.50 to 1.00 lower. Top 53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-450 lbs   49.50-50.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs   50.00-50.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   50.50-51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     550-700 lbs   52.00-53.00</p>
